          "Title": "Lowtide",
          "Author": null,
          "Changes": "",
          "Description": "A port's old warehouse quarter at low tide: red-brick warehouses either side of a tidal canal whose bed is mud and a channel of water, a bridge at its north end, a footbridge over its mouth and the harbour quay with its cranes.",
